{"id":"539ea70f","type":"about","label":"About the studio","html":"<section class=\"cmp cmp-about section\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"cmp-about__top\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">About us</p>\n      <p class=\"cmp-about__statement\">We design calm, honest interiors and build them end to end, so every room feels considered and every rupee is accounted for.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cmp-about__grid\">\n      <figure class=\"cmp-about__img cmp-about__img--tall\">\n        <img src=\"https://interior-site-murex.vercel.app/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdesigns%2Findian-contemporary-living.jpg&w=3840&q=75\" alt=\"A living room with carved arches, jaali and brass lanterns\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      </figure>\n      <div class=\"cmp-about__copy\">\n        <p class=\"lead\">We start with how you live: your routine, your storage, your light. Then we plan, design, source and install everything with one accountable team.</p>\n        <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/about\">View more →</a>\n        <figure class=\"cmp-about__img\">\n          <img src=\"https://interior-site-murex.vercel.app/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fsite%2Fmaterials.jpg&w=3840&q=75\" alt=\"Fabric, wood and stone samples\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cmp-about__side\">\n        <figure class=\"cmp-about__img\">\n          <img src=\"https://interior-site-murex.vercel.app/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdesigns%2Fscandinavian-bedroom.jpg&w=3840&q=75\" alt=\"A calm bedroom in light oak and linen\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </figure>\n        <h3 class=\"h3\">Transforming your ideas into lasting spaces.</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Layouts that work, materials that age well and lighting that changes with the day. We revise until every room feels right.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <style>\n    .cmp-about .cmp-about__top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:2rem;align-items:start;margin-bottom:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.5rem)}\n    .cmp-about .cmp-about__statement{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3.2vw,2.6rem);line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0;color:var(--fg);max-width:22ch*2}\n    .cmp-about .cmp-about__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(1.25rem,3vw,2.5rem);align-items:start}\n    .cmp-about .cmp-about__img{margin:0;border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:4/3;background:var(--surface)}\n    .cmp-about .cmp-about__img--tall{aspect-ratio:3/4}\n    .cmp-about .cmp-about__img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transition:transform .6s ease}\n    .cmp-about .cmp-about__img:hover img{transform:scale(1.04)}\n    .cmp-about .cmp-about__copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:1rem}\n    .cmp-about .cmp-about__copy .lead{margin:0}\n    .cmp-about .cmp-about__copy .cmp-about__img{width:100%;margin-top:1rem}\n    .cmp-about .cmp-about__side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.9rem;padding-top:clamp(0rem,8vw,6rem)}\n    .cmp-about .cmp-about__side .h3{margin:.75rem 0 0}\n    .cmp-about .cmp-about__side .muted{margin:0}\n    @media (max-width:900px){\n      .cmp-about .cmp-about__top{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.75rem}\n      .cmp-about .cmp-about__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}\n      .cmp-about .cmp-about__img--tall{grid-column:1/-1;aspect-ratio:16/10}\n      .cmp-about .cmp-about__side{padding-top:0}\n    }\n    @media (max-width:600px){.cmp-about .cmp-about__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n  </style>\n</section>","sourceUrl":"https://interior-site-murex.vercel.app/","createdAt":"2026-10-17T08:22:51.737Z"}